</p>
<p>
<span>The text is a good introduction to art and art history . It is not a chronological art history text but covers several periods, art forms and ideas related to understanding art.</span>
<a aria-label="Expand review by Marla Sweeney, Adjunct Instrcutor, Middlesex Community College" class="review-expander" data-action="common--toggleable#toggle" role="link">read more</a>
</p>
</div>
